<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed lower in heavy trading Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 18.88 to 6877.68.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 1.81 to 413.59.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.18.</p>
<p>Losers beat gainers 1532 to 931.</p>
<p>Volume was 535,552,530 compared with 467,304,080 on Tuesday.</p>
